# Written at run time in your own account. .state.json holds your account id, your resource ARNs and
# the Region and prefix of the deploy; results/ holds your numbers. Do not commit or share them.
.state.json
.state.json.tmp
# Any copy you make by hand (.state.json.bak, .state.json.old) holds the same account id and ARNs.
.state.json*
config.env
results/
